        {
            "title": "New from the developer: Beckett",
            "date": "2018-03-04 11:06:28",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/2363699280668208602",
            "notes": "The latest game from 39 Steps creator Simon Meek is now on Steam  \r\n\r\nhttp://store.steampowered.com/app/588230/Beckett/ \r\n\r\nBeckett is a surreal-noir by The Secret Experiment - an original story that Rolling Stone describes as \"Part Detective Story, Part Dadaist Nightmare... A rare example of total and genuine auteurism in the games world”. Hope you like it. Thanks again for all your support."
        },
